  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2) Mail Gonder\n\n**Girilecek credential:**\n- `Gmail: Mail Gonder` node -> **Gmail OAuth2** credential.\n  (SMTP tercih ederseniz bu node'u **Send Email** node'u ile\n  degistirip SMTP credential'i girin; alan adlari aynidir.)\n\n**Panele baglama:**\nWebhook Production URL'ini panelin `.env` dosyasindaki\n`N8N_SEND_MAIL_WEBHOOK` degiskenine yazin.\n\n### Spam onlemleri - GEVSETMEYIN\n- `Alici Dongusu` batch size **1** olmali (toplu gonderim yok).\n- `Bekleme Suresi` 30-90 sn rastgele bekleme uretir.\n- Video mail'e **ek** olarak degil, govdedeki **link** olarak gider.\n- Gunluk limit zaten panelde uygulanir; buraya sadece izin verilen\n  sayida alici gelir.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "b9dab914-7487-4a23-9eab-64a331920d44",
      "name": "Kurulum Notu",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "mail-gonder",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "45b10a56-444b-4aa0-bcba-e436b3c2ebf2",
      "name": "Panel Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        592,
        368
      ],
      "webhookId": "a1b2c3d4-mail-gonder-0002",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Panel \"Gonder\" butonu buraya POST eder."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Panelden gelen listeyi alici basina bir item haline getirir.\n// Ortak alanlar (subject/bodyHtml) her item'a kopyalanir ki dongu\n// icinde ek node referansina gerek kalmasin.\nconst body = items[0].json.body || items[0].json;\nconst alicilar = body.recipients || [];\n\nif (!alicilar.length) throw new Error(\"recipients bos geldi.\");\n\nreturn alicilar.map((r) => ({\n  json: {\n    campaignId: body.campaignId,\n    subject: body.subject,\n    bodyHtml: body.bodyHtml,\n    videoUrl: body.videoUrl || \"\",\n    callbackUrl: body.callbackUrl,\n    panelKey: body.panelKey,\n    leadId: r.leadId,\n    email: r.email,\n    business_name: r.business_name || \"\",\n    website: r.website || \"\",\n    phone: r.phone || \"\",\n    address: r.address || \"\",\n    unsubscribeUrl: r.unsubscribeUrl || \"\",\n  },\n}));"
      },
      "id": "ed95738c-42bb-4dfd-8b7a-f2f09e3de5f8",
      "name": "Alicilari Hazirla",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        784,
        368
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: true, kuyruga_alinan: $items().length }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f6bf68a6-4499-4942-bebd-7545d7fdf629",
      "name": "Panele Hemen Yanit Ver",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        992,
        368
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Gonderim saatler surebilir; panel beklemesin diye hemen yanit doner."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f9ba99c0-ad3a-408a-b4b9-22546a02cf97",
      "name": "Alici Dongusu",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1184,
        368
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "batchSize 1: alicilara TEK TEK gonderilir."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "09b3bd8e-09e5-4ab8-8cda-505493a07312",
      "name": "Gonderim Bitti",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1408,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// {{business_name}} gibi yer tutuculari bu aliciya gore doldurur.\n// Video mail'e EK olarak eklenmez; govdedeki LINK olarak kalir.\nconst d = items[0].json;\n\nconst kacir = (s) => String(s == null ? \"\" : s)\n  .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\").replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n  .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\").replace(/\"/g, \"&quot;\");\n\nconst alanlar = {\n  business_name: d.business_name,\n  website: d.website,\n  email: d.email,\n  phone: d.phone,\n  address: d.address,\n  unsubscribe_url: d.unsubscribeUrl,\n};\n\n// govde HTML oldugu icin kacislanir; konu duz metindir, kacislanmaz.\nconst doldur = (metin, htmlMi) => {\n  let out = String(metin || \"\");\n  for (const [ad, deger] of Object.entries(alanlar)) {\n    const yerine = htmlMi ? kacir(deger) : String(deger == null ? \"\" : deger);\n    out = out.replace(new RegExp(\"{{\\\\s*\" + ad + \"\\\\s*}}\", \"g\"), yerine);\n  }\n  return out;\n};\n\nreturn [{ json: Object.assign({}, d, {\n  subjectFinal: doldur(d.subject, false).replace(/<[^>]*>/g, \"\").trim(),\n  bodyFinal: doldur(d.bodyHtml, true),\n}) }];"
      },
      "id": "7bac4cb1-042d-438d-90ac-08ff521b5396",
      "name": "Maili Kisisellestir",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1408,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.subjectFinal }}",
        "message": "={{ $json.bodyFinal }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "6bd08864-d54a-432e-9b7e-7de6e0c24733",
      "name": "Gmail: Mail Gonder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1632,
        480
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "webhookId": "a1b2c3d4-gmail-send-0002",
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "DkwkILHnyPZM33OG",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "CREDENTIAL: Gmail OAuth2. Video EK DEGIL, govdede link olarak gider."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Maili Kisisellestir').item.json.callbackUrl }}/{{ $('Maili Kisisellestir').item.json.leadId }}/status",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-panel-key",
              "value": "={{ $('Maili Kisisellestir').item.json.panelKey }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ status: \"gonderildi\" }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8edb6cc3-8bf0-429b-9f4a-717a7964754c",
      "name": "Panel: Gonderildi Isaretle",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1840,
        480
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Credential gerekmez; x-panel-key panelden gelir."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Spam filtrelerine takilmamak icin gonderimler arasi rastgele bekleme.\n// SURE DUSURULMEMELI: 30-90 saniye araligi bilincli secilmistir.\nconst saniye = Math.floor(Math.random() * 61) + 30; // 30-90\nreturn [{ json: Object.assign({}, items[0].json, { waitSeconds: saniye }) }];"
      },
      "id": "2072d4c5-9fa5-43b8-8235-cb0230178767",
      "name": "Bekleme Suresi (30-90 sn)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2064,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ $json.waitSeconds }}"
      },
      "id": "a7904db3-190d-433d-8c51-88021a07529e",
      "name": "Bekle",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        2288,
        480
      ],
      "webhookId": "a1b2c3d4-mail-wait-0002",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Sonraki aliciya gecmeden once bekler."
    }
  ],
